```python
if env["disable_3d"]:
        if env.editor_build:
            print("Build option 'disable_3d=yes' cannot be used for editor builds, only for export template builds.")
            Exit(255)
        else:
            env.Append(CPPDEFINES=["_3D_DISABLED"])
```

