This is not correct. Matrix multiplication is not commutative. `transform * vector` is the same as `transform.xform(vector)`, and `vector * transform` is the same as `transform.xform_inv(vector)`. See these lines in `core/variant/variant_op.cpp` for reference:

```cpp
register_op<OperatorEvaluatorXForm<Vector2, Transform2D, Vector2>>(Variant::OP_MULTIPLY, Variant::TRANSFORM2D, Variant::VECTOR2);
register_op<OperatorEvaluatorXFormInv<Vector2, Vector2, Transform2D>>(Variant::OP_MULTIPLY, Variant::VECTOR2, Variant::TRANSFORM2D);
```

